### REEH 상속 + Security 앞 Filter 가 getParameter 를 먼저 부르고 예외를 잡음(param-peek)
| case | status | content-type | WWW-Authenticate | body |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| POST /x1up/upload (4096 bytes) | 413 | application/problem+json | - | {"detail":"Maximum upload size exceeded","instance":"/x1up/upload","status":413,"title":"Content Too Large"} |
  dispatch: [REQUEST /x1up/upload]
  resolver saw: [REQUEST org.springframework.web.multipart.MaxUploadSizeExceededException <- cause org.apache.tomcat.util.http.InvalidParameterException <- cause org.apache.tomcat.util.http.fileupload.impl.FileSizeLimitExceededException]
  param-peek: [getParameter threw org.apache.tomcat.util.http.InvalidParameterException <- cause org.apache.tomcat.util.http.fileupload.impl.FileSizeLimitExceededException -> caught, chain continues]
| POST /x1up/upload (100 bytes, 대조군) | 200 | application/json | - | {"size":100} |
